  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Solution": "The five numbers being subtracted each end in \\(2\\). Their ones digits total \\(5\\cdot2=10\\), which carries into the tens column and leaves \\(0\\) in the ones column of their sum. Subtracting this sum from \\(222,222\\) therefore gives \\(2-0=2\\) in the ones column. The answer is \\(\\boxed{2}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
